# AGENT_SECRET gates /ws/ext and every session route. Leave it empty and
# `docker compose up` refuses to start and says why, which is the behaviour
# you want. Do not paste a value here: whatever is in this file is published
# in the repository, and this secret protects a relay that can drive a
# logged-in browser.
#
# Generate one instead:
#   python3 -c 'import secrets;print(secrets.token_urlsafe(32))'
AGENT_SECRET=